      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Huntington%2C_Massachusetts"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1841 the Western Railroad reached Huntington, spurring manufacturing and drawing new settlers to the area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
